# Your Unmap browser key, from https://unmap.dev/dashboard. No add-on is needed.
# The key ships in the browser bundle: restrict it to your origins (e.g. http://localhost:3210 and
# your production domain) in the dashboard.
NEXT_PUBLIC_UNMAP_KEY=

# Optional. The path the app is served under, e.g. /alive-maps. Empty for a site of its own.
# BASE_PATH=
